VERSION 2

// This file defines global actions that may be performed
// by avatars on other objects in the world.  Each line in
// order is as follows:
// -ACTION followed by the action name
// -Name of avatar this action applies to, or "any"
// -Name of object this action applies to (less file extension,
// and can just match the end of the object URL.) This may be
// any Shape or Shape-derived object, in addition to other avatars
// -If this action applies to another avatar, does this action
// require consent from the other avatar? consent/noconsent
// -Relative x,y target position of avatar to object in world
// units (cm)
// -Relative yaw of avatar to target object orientation in degrees
// -Action to perform prior to animation, can be "noAction", 
// "addToInventory", "removeObject", "animateObject", "playSound" or
// "moveObjectTo".  In client version 1636 only noAction, 
// animateObject, and playSound are supported.
// -Optional parameter for the action, required for animateObject
// or moveObjectTo
// -Animation to have avatar perform upon reaching target pos.
// -Action to perform as animation starts
// -Optional parameter for above action
// -Action to perform after the animation is complete
// -Optional parameter for above action
// -An optional second animation to perform after everything else
// or "none"

// No actions currently defined externally

